        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "RAY COOKE AUCTIONEERS are delighted to bring this spacious A Rated 3 bedroom, 3 bathroom Family home with clever Attic Conversion to the Lucan market ideally positioned on Stratton Drive, Adamstown. This highly desirable development is located close to Lucan Village with every imaginable amenity on your doorstep. Within a stone's throw you will find local bars, shops, schools, along with a host of bus routes, the N4 & M50 road networks and Adamstown Train Station with its routes in and out of the city centre.\nBright and spacious living accommodation extending to approximately 135 sq. m. is set across three floors. The ground floor comprises a welcoming entrance hallway with understairs storage and a guest W.C, leading to a bright front living room with a feature wall. To the rear, the open-plan kitchen/dining area is complemented by a separate utility room and provides direct access to the sunny, low-maintenance rear garden. The first floor hosts three generously proportioned bedrooms, including a spacious principal bedroom with an en-suite, together with the main family bathroom. The converted attic on the top floor has been cleverly designed to create two versatile additional rooms, currently used as fourth and fifth bedrooms. These flexible spaces are ideal for growing families, accommodating guests, or providing a home office/ playroom to suit a variety of needs.\nNo. 11 comes to the market in Turn Key condition throughout and further benefits from an A Ber rating, fully alarmed, designated parking, sunny rear garden with artificial grass, clever designed attic acting as 4th and 5th bedrooms with additional living space. Based on recent success in the Adamstown area, we know this property will be very popular so contact Ray Cooke Auctioneers at your earliest convenience to register your interest.\n\nAdditonal Features:\n<ul>\n <li>A rated BER qualifying for a green mortgage\n• 3 BED / 3 BATH SEMI-D\n• Clever attic conversion with additional 4th and 5th bedrooms\n• Low maintenance rear garden with artificial grass\n• Designated Parking to the front\n• Built in 2017\n• Management fees c. 550 p/a\n• Gas central heating\n• Adamstown Train station only minutes away\n• Lucan Village & Liffey Valley Shopping centre only a short drive\n• Enquire NOW so you don't miss out!</li>\n</ul>\n\nDirections:\nEircode = K78 AE37"
      },
